problems.problem:
Find all functions $f: \mathbb{Q}^{+} \to \mathbb{Q}^{+}$ which satisfy the conditions

(i) $f(x+1)=f(x)+1$ for all $x \in \mathbb{Q}^{+}$;

(ii) $f(x^2)=f(x)^2$ for all $x \in \mathbb{Q}^{+}$.

Can the number $2016$ be represented as a sum of cubes of:

a) three natural numbers;

b) four natural numbers?
